1a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芜湖遇陈山人鹤席上分韵三首赠之 其三","author":"宗臣","text":"相逢秋色起芜关，明月千峰未可还。\n莫怪征衣霞气满，知君家在会稽山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":29714,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过采石怀李白十首 其一","author":"宗臣","text":"阊阖天门夜不关，酒星何日谪人间。\n为君五斗金茎露，醉杀江南千万山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":29715,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过采石怀李白十首 其二","author":"宗臣","text":"忆君乘月下金陵，何处吴山不夜登。\n一曲潇湘秋万里，至今疑在白云层。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":29716,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过采石怀李白十首 其三","author":"宗臣","text":"楚水秋风薜荔高，千帆明月大江涛。\n娥眉亭下芙蓉色，犹似当年宫锦袍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":29717,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过采石怀李白十首 其四","author":"宗臣","text":"夜夜银河倒不流，长虹西挂彩云愁。\n醉来江底抱明月，惊落天门万片秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":29718,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过采石怀李白十首 其五","author":"宗臣","text":"到处孤槎秋万重，沧江终夜卧鱼龙。\n天风驱尽潇湘色，祗为仙人破醉容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":29719,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过采石怀李白十首 其六","author":"宗臣","text":"秋山万仞落秋潭，无限青枫好驻骖。\n君跨长鲸去不返，独留明月照江南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":29720,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过采石怀李白十首 其七","author":"宗臣","text":"采石矶头坐白云，归来瑶草乱纷纷。\n夜深吹笛江亭上，明月窥人恐是君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":29721,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过采石怀李白十首 其八","author":"宗臣","text":"楚江南折是天门，江上蛟龙日夜喧。\n为尔片帆开暮雨，至今秋色锁云根。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":29722,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过采石怀李白十首 其九","author":"宗臣","text":"短筇踏破楚山青，日日苍梧醉洞庭。\n何事淹留姑孰水，千秋风雨怨湘灵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":29723,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过采石怀李白十首 其十","author":"宗臣","text":"西望匡庐接九华，当年醉色傲烟霞。\n可怜一片寒江月，犹有千峰护落花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":29724,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻张山人在芜湖不得见怀之","author":"宗臣","text":"采石矶头秋雨晴，芜湖城外暮潮生。\n美人只在江波上，十里芙蓉愁月明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":29725,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀海樵山人","author":"宗臣","text":"海樵山人双紫髯，道上相逢开石函。\n赠我芙蓉千万片，至今秋色满江南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":29726,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泾县望桃花潭","author":"宗臣","text":"桃花潭水近陵阳，潭上春风满石梁。\n流水不随仙客去，秦人何必渡三湘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":29727,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仙人石","author":"宗臣","text":"秋风夜渡仙人石，百尺奇峰扫天碧。\n我欲扪萝枕石眠，明月偏醉广陵客。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":29728,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王子夜半来过席间有赠走笔相荅","author":"宗臣","text":"秋雷一动蛟龙走，王生夜半寻五斗。\n把酒向天天忽开，星辰错落乱吾手。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":29729,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜召明卿报言病目畏灯火走笔戏简二绝 其一","author":"宗臣","text":"秋云落尽潇湘曲，更有何人抱寒玉。\n堂前银烛岂黄尘，相逢不肯开君目。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":29730,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜召明卿报言病目畏灯火走笔戏简二绝 其二","author":"宗臣","text":"昨日见君双眼青，今日见君双眼赤。\n江南百战天地摧，岂应欲化苌弘碧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":29731,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人日大雪峻伯助甫来过赋得榆愁门阳四字四首 其一","author":"宗臣","text":"七日之春春可呼，相逢斗酒醉屠苏。\n却疑金胜天门堕，把向阶前成白榆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":29732,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人日大雪峻伯助甫来过赋得榆愁门阳四字四首 其二","author":"宗臣","text":"已知青帝坐青阳，玄冥使者又飞杨。\n不是春风吹不去，知君欲跨白虹翔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":29733,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人日大雪峻伯助甫来过赋得榆愁门阳四字四首 其三","author":"宗臣","text":"春色尚闭杨柳园，杨花柳絮何翩翻。\n胡奴系马庭前树，疑是玉龙来叩门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":29734,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人日大雪峻伯助甫来过赋得榆愁门阳四字四首 其四","author":"宗臣","text":"冻云裂破青春流，天门牛女争春愁。\n剪碎银河几万片，一宵白尽青山头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":29735,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"席上酬助甫","author":"宗臣","text":"槛外春云控紫骝，腰间明月冷吴钩。\n酒酣把赠天风起，吹作湘江白鹭秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":29736,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"助甫宅见盆梅同子藩赋之得东愁二字","author":"宗臣","text":"径尺苍虬坠碧空，天风吹作玉玲珑。\n尊前明月争相拾，恐逐仙人过海东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":29737,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"助甫宅见盆梅同子藩赋之得东愁二字","author":"宗臣","text":"斗室梅花玉笛愁，相逢疑在赤城头。\n何当掷尔潇湘去，处处鲛人惊白鸥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":29738,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白云樵者二首 其一","author":"宗臣","text":"赤城花落扫春氛，夜夜仙人弄白云。\n杂佩幽兰何处得，洞庭明月问湘君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":29739,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白云樵者二首 其二","author":"宗臣","text":"十日峰头摘白云，月华相逐夜缤纷。\n晓来片片晴虹气，恐是仙人素练裙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":29740,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]